    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that initiates an OAuth or OIDC authorization-code login using a concrete external provider. I will use Google as the external provider for this example, as it is a widely used and well-documented OAuth provider. The script will import the necessary libraries, set up the OAuth client, and generate the authorization URL for the user to visit and authorize the application. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862989842,
          "start": 1789862986085
        },
        "type": "text"
